  "contract": "Given finite acyclic ground term nodes with uninterpreted symbols, equations, and equality queries: return least equivalence relation containing the equations and closed under functions with equal symbols and pointwise equal arguments; booleans represent logical entailment, NOT proof of disequality.",
  "input": "nodes topological DAG ids, single fixed symbol arity, equality pairs and queries; no variables, quantifiers, rewriting, host effects, numeric semantics, structural D2 or device state",
  "output": "lexicographically stable partition classes plus ordered entailed booleans",
  "minimality_review": "POTENTIALLY DERIVABLE using union-find and D9 fixed-point/list operations: no independent Core root proved; owner decides whether D10 or library",
  "primary_sources": [
    {
      "author": "Greg Nelson; Derek C. Oppen",
      "year": "1980",
      "title": "Fast Decision Procedures Based on Congruence Closure",
      "doi": "10.1145/322186.322198",
